  "goodToKnow": "Das Heilmittel is a remedy or cure: ein natürliches Heilmittel, kein Heilmittel gegen. Das Allheilmittel is a cure-all, often ironic: Digitalisierung ist kein Allheilmittel. In German health insurance, Heilmittel are therapies like physiotherapy and speech therapy, while drugs are Arzneimittel. Heilen means to heal, and die Heilpraktikerin is a naturopath, a profession recognised by law in Germany. Plural: die Heilmittel."
